      "title": "Cross-Emirate HIE Consent Synchronization Rules",
      "type": "no_provision_found",
      "description": "The available text does not provide specific rules or technical standards governing how patient consent granted in one emirate's exchange (e.g., NABIDH in Dubai) is harmonized or legally operationalized across exchange platforms in another emirate (e.g., Malaffi in Abu Dhabi).",
      "citations": [
        "dha-health-info-sharing-2024#0015",
        "doh-hie-policy-2020#0022"
      ],
      "recommendation": "Consult regulatory guidance from DHA, DoH, and the Ministry of Health and Prevention (MOHAP) regarding technical inter-system consent synchronization mechanisms."
    }
